{"id":"efcd33b278c102f5","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-cyk-table.md","title":"CYK 的三角动态规划表","display":"df-cyk-table — CYK 的三角动态规划表","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-cyk-table","aliases":["73-df-cyk-table"],"display":"df-cyk-table — CYK 的三角动态规划表","depends_on":["[[73-df-standard-cnf]]","[[73-df-word-factors]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.4, print pp. 299–307; PDF pp. 321–329; local algorithmic corollary","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§6.3 and Fig. 6.8, pp. 139–140; scans 147–148","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-cyk-table"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-cyk-table</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cyk-table — CYK 的三角动态规划表"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" href=\"?note=7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" title=\"73-df-standard-cnf\">73-df-standard-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2a897e9cc590dbba\" href=\"?note=2a897e9cc590dbba\" title=\"73-df-word-factors\">73-df-word-factors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.4, print pp. 299–307; PDF pp. 321–329; local algorithmic corollary"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§6.3 and Fig. 6.8, pp. 139–140; scans 147–148"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{CNF}(G)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" href=\"?note=7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" title=\"73-df-standard-cnf\">73-df-standard-cnf</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|w|\">\\(n=|w|\\)</span>，截取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w[i:j]\">\\(w[i:j]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2a897e9cc590dbba\" href=\"?note=2a897e9cc590dbba\" title=\"73-df-word-factors\">73-df-word-factors</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；各递归子句另外满足所显示的区间条件，分割变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 由有限并的整数下标绑定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{G,w}\">\\(C_{G,w}\\)</span> 的递归按区间长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j-i\">\\(j-i\\)</span> 进行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}table}\\vdash\n\\mathcal I_n\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in\\mathbb N^2:0\\le i&lt;j\\le n\\},\\qquad C_{G,w}:\\mathcal I_n\\to\\mathcal P(V)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}table}\\vdash\n\\mathcal I_n\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in\\mathbb N^2:0\\le i&lt;j\\le n\\},\\qquad C_{G,w}:\\mathcal I_n\\to\\mathcal P(V)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nC_{G,w}(i,i+1)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in V:(A,\\langle w(i)\\rangle)\\in P\\}\\quad(0\\le i&lt;n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nC_{G,w}(i,i+1)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in V:(A,\\langle w(i)\\rangle)\\in P\\}\\quad(0\\le i&lt;n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nC_{G,w}(i,j)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k=i+1}^{j-1}\\{A\\in V:\\exists B\\in C_{G,w}(i,k)\\;\\exists D\\in C_{G,w}(k,j)\\;(A,BD)\\in P\\}\\quad(0\\le i&lt;j\\le n,\\ j-i\\ge2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nC_{G,w}(i,j)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k=i+1}^{j-1}\\{A\\in V:\\exists B\\in C_{G,w}(i,k)\\;\\exists D\\in C_{G,w}(k,j)\\;(A,BD)\\in P\\}\\quad(0\\le i&lt;j\\le n,\\ j-i\\ge2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空输入时表的定义域为空。每个后继格只读取更短区间，保证有限递归存在唯一；规则中的两个变量记 B、D，避免与整张表 C 混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-standard-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"7fc5fa30c0841ef9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-standard-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-word-factors","status":"resolved","id":"2a897e9cc590dbba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-word-factors]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-standard-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"7fc5fa30c0841ef9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CNF}(G)$，见 [[73-df-standard-cnf]]；$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$n=|w|$，截取 $w[i:j]$ 见 [[73-df-word-factors]]。$i,j\\in\\mathbb N$；各递归子句另外满足所显示的区间条件，分割变量 $k$ 由有限并的整数下标绑定。$C_{G,w}$ 的递归按区间长度 $j-i$ 进行。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-word-factors","status":"resolved","id":"2a897e9cc590dbba","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CNF}(G)$，见 [[73-df-standard-cnf]]；$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$n=|w|$，截取 $w[i:j]$ 见 [[73-df-word-factors]]。$i,j\\in\\mathbb N$；各递归子句另外满足所显示的区间条件，分割变量 $k$ 由有限并的整数下标绑定。$C_{G,w}$ 的递归按区间长度 $j-i$ 进行。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CNF}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"n=|w|","display":false},{"tex":"w[i:j]","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"C_{G,w}","display":false},{"tex":"j-i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}table}\\vdash\n\\mathcal I_n\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in\\mathbb N^2:0\\le i<j\\le n\\},\\qquad C_{G,w}:\\mathcal I_n\\to\\mathcal P(V)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nC_{G,w}(i,i+1)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in V:(A,\\langle w(i)\\rangle)\\in P\\}\\quad(0\\le i<n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cyk\\text{-}table}\\vdash\nC_{G,w}(i,j)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k=i+1}^{j-1}\\{A\\in V:\\exists B\\in C_{G,w}(i,k)\\;\\exists D\\in C_{G,w}(k,j)\\;(A,BD)\\in P\\}\\quad(0\\le i<j\\le n,\\ j-i\\ge2)","display":true}],"bytes":1918,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-cyk-table]]"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-cyk-table|CYK 的三角动态规划表]]"},{"id":"7dfe6507d0831ed2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[73-df-cyk-table]] 的同一 $G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)$、$w$、$n$ 和 $C_{G,w}$。生成语言和推导见 [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]。"},{"id":"44b877e4bba023fa","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["7fc5fa30c0841ef9","2a897e9cc590dbba"]}